Add optional Lomin login for workflow API calls

Introduce login_module.py with sync POST to /cognition-api/api/v2/account/login,
token caching, and origin derivation from the workflow URL. When auth credentials
are supplied (CLI or LOMIN_AUTH_* env), request_api attaches Authorization and
sends combined params JSON matching the reference client; otherwise behavior is
unchanged. Retry once after invalidating the cache on HTTP 401.
